NSS 11.4 clients: main/Linux 6.18 API compatibility

Apply after the forty unchanged qosmio 11.4 upstream patches.
Rebase main compat fixes onto the inline/per-qdisc 11.4 architecture.
Keep the 12.5.5 source and patch arm untouched. Source-only validation;
compilation, firmware interoperability and device testing are outstanding.

